[00:08.050]Let's go out and be wild (让我们走出禁锢，释放自我)
[00:10.010]Do it while we can (do, do) (人生在世须尽欢)
[00:15.760]Running free in the world (自由自在地奔跑)
[00:17.810]We got all weekend (do, do) (没有假期的困扰)
[00:22.110]
[00:22.440]Tear it up, tear it down (抛掉烦恼，突破羁绊)
[00:24.410]Getting lost in the sound of our hearts beating (在彼此的心跳声中迷失)
[00:30.230]Take me here, take me now (就在此地，就在此刻，带我出发)
[00:32.189]Getting lost in a crowd with you (随你消逝在人山人海中)
[00:38.010]
[00:38.830]Up, all night (尽兴到整夜)
[00:41.520]I waited for you all my life (我用尽一生将你等待)
[00:45.200]Hold my hand and keep me close (握紧我的手，让我贴近你)
[00:47.360]I'll never let you go (坚决不会放你离去)
